  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.26,
      "end_seconds": 4.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I think it's my turn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.36,
      "end_seconds": 9.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.99,
      "end_seconds": 21.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. He's been feeling well, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.49,
      "end_seconds": 26.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.54,
      "end_seconds": 31.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "erm, I take Eltroxin, every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.74,
      "end_seconds": 33.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.25,
      "end_seconds": 49.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "100 micrograms, I think that's what's on the box i'm on sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.99,
      "end_seconds": 53.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.63,
      "end_seconds": 58.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I've had it for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.94,
      "end_seconds": 61.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.17,
      "end_seconds": 74.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "right, I'd give it it a four, out of ten there was slightly dry skin, yes, but that went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.79,
      "end_seconds": 78.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Alright, nothing like feeling cold?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.33,
      "end_seconds": 81.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, no feeling cold."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.0,
      "end_seconds": 89.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any constipation, weight change or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.84,
      "end_seconds": 96.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.8,
      "end_seconds": 100.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.26,
      "end_seconds": 105.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Let me think, no, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.47,
      "end_seconds": 114.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.5,
      "end_seconds": 119.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "okay, so no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.05,
      "end_seconds": 136.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.52,
      "end_seconds": 144.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid. It's the not knowing that gets to me. Yes, migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.13,
      "end_seconds": 156.82,
      "duration_seconds": 11.69,
      "text": "Right, so an underactive thyroid is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.46,
      "end_seconds": 163.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "my mother had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.37,
      "end_seconds": 177.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.67,
      "end_seconds": 181.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Erythromycin. I come out in... well, a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.18,
      "end_seconds": 186.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.17,
      "end_seconds": 194.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Actually, yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.71,
      "end_seconds": 200.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.14,
      "end_seconds": 213.15,
      "duration_seconds": 12.01,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital. No, I share a house with my brother. I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.45,
      "end_seconds": 216.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "let's start with the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.07,
      "end_seconds": 227.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Right, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.47,
      "end_seconds": 265.33,
      "duration_seconds": 16.86,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.8, blood pressure 110 over 70. And weight 89 kilos, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, pulse 78, height 173 centimetres. From what you've told me, I'd lean towards well-controlled thyroid replacement."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.59,
      "end_seconds": 271.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I mean, you know, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.94,
      "end_seconds": 280.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to to an emergency. It looks like well-controlled thyroid replacement, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.66,
      "end_seconds": 311.44,
      "duration_seconds": 20.78,
      "text": "Let's get a thyroid blood test, for annual review. Keep taking the tablet on an empty stomach, apart from coffee. One warning sign to remember: you notice palpitations or weight change. In that case don't wait. We'll catch up in twelve months. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.98,
      "end_seconds": 314.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}